OL,3,GNEWSAFire at abandoned Coatbridge
OL,4,Aschool was started deliberately
OL,5,
OL,6,FA large fire that wrecked a former
OL,7,Fprimary school building in North
OL,8,FLanarkshire was started deliberately,
OL,9,Fsay police.
OL,11,FSix Scottish Fire and Rescue Service
OL,12,F(SFRS) crews were called to the former
OL,13,FGreenhill Primary School site in at
OL,14,F17:35 Coatbridge on Tuesday.
OL,16,FThe building dates from 1902 and was a
OL,17,Fprimary school for more than a century
OL,18,Funtil its closure in 2012.
OL,20,FThe structure was badly damaged in the
OL,21,Ffire but there were no injuries. Police
OL,22,FScotland said inquiries were ongoing.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
